          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "ELE_net received very positive feedback from the students taking the courses. Building on this success, ELE_net is planning to over the Summer and Winter programmes again in 2019 and add additional courses, such as Conversational English and Academic Grammar.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "To register online for the Summer 2019 courses, please go to \n      ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "https://www.aku.edu/ele-net/students/Pages/Student_English_Courses.aspx",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "http://www.aku.edu/ele-net/students/Pages/Student_English_Courses.aspx",
