    "show_share": true,
    "description": "After the success of the Summer English Courses last year, ELE_net offered a programme of Winter English Courses. This consisted of the following courses: Academic Discussion Skills, Academic Presentation Skills, English for the Media and Language Accuracy in Writing. The courses ran over a four-week period from mid-November. Attendance on the courses was very good, with over 150 students registering for them.",
